  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Royal School of Administration of Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to enhancing the expertise of civil servants and the effectiveness of public services through public sector personnel management and training capacity building and providing relevant infrastructure, and ICT utilization capacity building&#xc778;&#xc0ac;&#xccb4;&#xacc4; &#xbc0f; &#xad50;&#xc721; &#xc778;&#xd504;&#xb77c; &#xac1c;&#xc120;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xacf5;&#xacf5;&#xd589;&#xc815; &#xd601;&#xc2e0; 							
&#xc815;&#xbcf4;&#xd1b5;&#xc2e0;&#xae30;&#xc220;&#xc744; &#xd65c;&#xc6a9;&#xd55c; &#xacf5;&#xacf5;&#xd589;&#xc815; &#xd6a8;&#xc728;&#xc131; &#xc81c;&#xace0;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project draft and propose civil servant personnel management master plan, improved appointment system and training curriculum, provide online training platform, ICT training, a Training Innovation Center, and relevant training equipment.</narrative>
  </description>
